{"pageid":1968,"title":"Toy Train","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Toy Train</span>","revid":20663,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><i><big>\"Choo Choo! Create your own custom train tracks and create the most popular train industry.\"</big></i>\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Toy Train</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3f/ToyTrainPic.png/revision/latest?cb=20241208043306\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"ToyTrainPic\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3f/ToyTrainPic.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241208043306\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3f/ToyTrainPic.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241208043306 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3f/ToyTrainPic.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241208043306 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"ToyTrainPic\" width=\"270\" height=\"236\" data-image-key=\"ToyTrainPic.png\" data-image-name=\"ToyTrainPic.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Oak Depot</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$2,400</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.45</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Toy Train</b> is a decorative object in <i>Oaklands</i>. It is a tiny steam train that runs on tracks. It was only purchasable during the 2023, 2024 and, 2025 Christmas event for $2,400 at The Oak Depot and 2400 Snowflakes in Santa's workshop respectively.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>Unboxing the Toy Train prompts the user with a placement system similar to running wires for <a href=\"/wiki/Logic\" title=\"Logic\">Logic</a> systems. Players can place rails anywhere they want on the property, though the rails will always face down towards the ground. There are no rules as to how large the rail system is, nor whether it intersects with itself or other props. All the player is required to do is to create a complete loop of rail.\n</p><p>Once completed, the Toy Train will run along the rails. It emits a chugging sound and occasionally plays a steam train horn sound.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"9eb0720c17a95a2066655f108496299d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:122px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Limited_in_Oak_Depot-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:120px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Limited_in_Oak_Depot.png\" title=\"Limited in Oak Depot.png (485 KB)\" style=\"height:120px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ac/Limited_in_Oak_Depot.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20231214125403\" title=\"Limited in Oak Depot.png (485 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Toy Train in Oak Depot\" height=\"120\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Limited in Oak Depot.png\" data-image-key=\"Limited_in_Oak_Depot.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Toy Train in Oak Depot\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Limited in Oak Depot.png (485 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Toy Train in Oak Depot\" height=\"120\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Limited in Oak Depot.png\" data-image-key=\"Limited_in_Oak_Depot.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Toy Train in Oak Depo